  "notes": "This is the original UK release on pink rim Island labels in matt gatefold cover containing lyrics.\nPolylined blue Island inner sleeve with Island Basing Street address.\nCat.# on cover, labels and runouts.\n\nThis release has on the back of the cover\n• bottom right edge: 'Printed and made by Tinsley Robor Group Ltd.'\n• bottom centre below the Island logo: 'island records ltd basing street london w11'\n\nThere is a very similar, but later release [r=6482587] with\n• bottom right edge: 'Printed in England by Robor Limited'\n• bottom centre below the Island logo: 'island records'",
  "released_formatted": "Feb 1972",
